--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Generated code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under gen/ are generated by protoc-gen-java (via the pinned remote
plugin buf.build/protocolbuffers/java) from the protocol buffer definitions in
`proto/` at the root of this repository, which are part of Loams and Apache-2.0
licensed. They carry their own "Generated by the protocol buffer compiler" headers.

The files under src/dev/loams/facade/ are NOT generated. They are the
hand-written Q604 fallback described in src/dev/loams/facade/Facade.java,
pending the Java facade renderer. See README.md, "What is generated and what is
not".
